          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_compressed_pooling_builds_hierarchy",
          "text": "Compressed pooling builds a hierarchy, and transposed convolution up-samples for predictions. Crucially, this cuts permutation modeling from n factorial to n squared, letting it scale to large graphs.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
